        "collapsible_tab_yM6GRV": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "☑️ Ships for FREE from Texas.",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>Ships today or next day on most orders. </strong> Some orders that are custom or large may take extra time to prepare.</p><ul><li><strong>Free shipping is 3-10 days, or choose a faster method at checkout</strong>.  Be sure to account for the 0-2 days it will take us to pack and ship an order, in addition to the shipping speed you choose.</li><li><strong>All orders ship as soon as possible</strong>.  We don't like waiting and you probably don't either.</li><li><strong>If there are delays:</strong> (Only if delays are in green, above, do we expect them), just know that we are on your side.  If you're waiting, we're waiting for you, plus hundreds and sometimes thousands of others to finish being made.</li><li>\"Ships out\" time are estimations.  Items that are custom, delayed, rejected, or affected by other acts of god will take additional time.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_NfPHPU": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "☑️ Why shop with Atomic Defense?",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<ol><li>Highly-rated <strong>4.8/5 star service</strong> with <strong>1200+ reviews</strong>, and counting!</li><li><strong>Secure transaction guaranteed</strong>.  AES-256 Military Encryption.</li><li><strong>USA Family-Owned Small Business</strong>.</li><li><strong>BBB A+</strong> Rated and Accredited.</li><li>Open Monday to Friday.  9:00 AM to 4:00 PM Pacific. </li><li><a href=\"https://www.atomicdefense.com/pages/warranty\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Atomic Defense Warranty Terms and Conditions\">Lifetime Warranty</a>.</li><li><strong>Free Shipping inside the USA</strong>. Period. No strings.</li><li><strong>Easy</strong> Returns and Exchanges.</li><li>Our support doesn't end after the sale.  <strong>We're here whenever you need us</strong>. </li></ol>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_64FUPK": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Need 10+ of these? Request a quote here:",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>Fill out the form for 10+ units by </strong><a href=\"https://www.atomicdefense.com/pages/government-bulk-ordering\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Atomic Defense Bulk Ordering and Government Orders\"><strong>clicking here</strong></a><strong>. (Total order must be $5,000 USD or more in value)</strong></p><p>CAGE: 9FAL3 <br/>UEI: QQ1EKLBAT886<br/>Address: 2491 Alluvial Ave. Clovis, CA 93611</p><p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0004/0635/5980/files/V2-Form889-filledout.pdf?v=1683248766\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Atomic Defense Form 889 Gov\">Government Form 889</a></p><p>Need to submit a PO for your department?  <a href=\"https://www.atomicdefense.com/pages/government-bulk-ordering\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.atomicdefense.com/pages/government-bulk-ordering\">Fill this out</a> and leave a note at the end.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_qmhbnc": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Return & Exchange policy:",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<ul><li><strong>Summary: </strong>Don't take those sweet Instagram pics and then try to return a used item. Must be within 30 days of delivery. </li><li><strong>Exchanges:</strong> Realized you need a different item? That's ok!  Exchanges and returns are incredibly easy.</li><li><strong>We are a Small Business:</strong>  We do the most we can to help with return costs, but we are not Amazon and cannot take hits or losses like Amazon. </li><li><strong>Wrong Items:</strong>  Mistakes rarely happen.  Atomic Defense takes pictures of orders before they are packaged and shipped.  We pay for return, recertification, and exchange shipping costs if we ever make a mistake on your orders. </li><li><strong>Rules for Returns:</strong>  We will deduct refurbishing costs, plus materials and labor, of used products or modified products - or decline the return.  This includes, but is not limited to; products with residue, smells, scratches, missing parts, debris, dents and damage. **We reserve the right to refuse returns.  Refused returns shipping cost back to the buyer are not covered by Atomic Defense.</li><li><strong>Packaging:</strong> Ensure returns are packaged safely with thick padding on all six sides.  Failure to correctly package returns may damage products and cost will be deducted from Buyer's account or return refused.</li><li><strong>Bulletproof products:</strong> No one else accepts returns on ballistic items.  We do.**  However, recertification X-Ray costs on returned ballistic items is 20%.</li><li><strong>Starting a return/exchange:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.atomicdefense.com/pages/return\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Start a return on Atomic Defense\">Click here</a></li></ul>"
          }
        },
